From: =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=9Ceasten=E2=80=9D?= <“1621586148@qq.com”>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 04:48:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(student-app): services integration, UI polish & custom
 dialog
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Services page: integrate 4 updated URLs + 5 new services from enterprise WeChat
- Services page: hide unlinked items (统一消息平台, 我的申请)
- Home: dynamic greeting based on time of day (was hardcoded '下午好')
- Services: remove undefined 'border-bottom' ghost class
- Profile: replace native uni.showModal with custom AppDialog component
  - '关于医小管' now shows MD3-styled alert with school icon
  - '退出登录' now shows confirm dialog with danger button
- New: AppDialog.vue component + useDialog.ts composable
- Coming Soon Sheet: update default description text
- Add .tasks/ docs: optimization plan, UI test report, changelog
